   <refbody>    <section>
      <p>The preview reconciliation feature allows you to preview the difference between the current or modified value in the document and the Contract Management values. The following tasks are available for reconciliation:</p>
      <ul>
         <li>Modify a smart field</li>
         <li>Mark a field</li>
         <li>Modify a marked field</li>
         <li>Modify a smart clause</li>
         <li>Insert as a smart clause</li>
         <li>Modify a marked clause</li>
         <li>Mark a clause for deletion</li>
      </ul>
    </section></refbody>
</reference>